{"version":1,"content":"<p>【慘了 😭】HDD 價格何時能返家鄉！</p><p>？</p><p>Seagate 在投資者電話會議上透露，基本上 2028 年所有 HDD 產能已經售罄，採購排單一路延至 2029 年以後，客戶甚至願意加錢搶貨，並預期在 2030 年前 HDD 產能亦難以滿足市場需求。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:41:20.630445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:35:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:11.770910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:20.570154+00:00","content_hash":"f93c6bab1f16dfeee3c080180e820aefb644e607fe37eb6540d6f676d06a8f2d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}